 unity hubs in Oakland\, Berkeley\, and beyond. Come curious — meet the c
 reative minds behind the work\, experience art where it’s made\, and lea
 ve inspired. Just in time for the holidays\, it’s also a wonderful oppor
 tunity to shop locally and find one-of-a-kind gifts directly from the arti
 sts who make them. Not sure where to start? Explore our Emerging Artists \
 , Community Hubs \, or find your favorite artwork using our Artist Directo
 ry ! ️ Open Studios : Dec 5-6 and 12-13\; 11am–5pm daily Art in your n
 eighborhoods across the East Bay Get your free ticket: Eventbrite HOW TO P
 ARTICIPATE: Visit eastbayopenstudios.com Browse artist profiles or use the
  interactive maps ( Weekend 1 + Weekend 2 ) Don’t know where to start? C
 heck out our Emerging Artists \, Community Hubs \, and Special Events . Ch
 oose your route and hit the studios! Open 11am–5pm each day
